--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
IEC 62443
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

ot_scout/frameworks.py cites IEC 62443-3-3 system requirements ("SR x.y") and
IEC 62443-2-4 practices by identifier. The identifiers are citations. The short
descriptions shown beside them are this project's own plain-English paraphrases
written for this tool; they are not the clause titles and not the normative text
of the standard, and nothing here reproduces it.

IEC 62443 is published by the International Electrotechnical Commission and is
available from IEC and its national committees. Refer to the standard itself for
the normative requirements.

The IEC has not reviewed, approved or endorsed OT Scout, and no association with
or sponsorship by the IEC is claimed or implied.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
IEEE MA-L (OUI) registry
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The "Update vendor database" feature downloads the IEEE MA-L public listing at
run time to map MAC address prefixes to manufacturers. The listing is published
by the IEEE Registration Authority and is not redistributed with OT Scout.

https://standards-oui.ieee.org/
